		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>A grey, gargoyleish head with bat-like wings. Spreads via contagious kiss.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 12, <strong>HP</strong> 9, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 kiss +2 (contagious kiss) or shriek, <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> -4, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +0, <strong>I</strong> -1, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> +1, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 2</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Contagious Kiss</strong>. Kisses helpless foe, CON 15+ or transform into vargouille over 1d4 days, head tearing free from the body on last day.</p><p></p><p><strong>Shriek</strong>. All enemies who can hear within near, CHA 15+ or paralyzed 1d4 rounds.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
